FAIL three refused in a row alert
FAIL three refused then stopped alert
ok   two refused then accepted no alert
ok   refused streak reset by an accepted step
FAIL an attempt past the limit alerts
ok   an attempt within the limit does not
ok   a refused attempt's clock restarts
FAIL a stalled refinement alerts
ok   a refinement to 1e-31 does not
FAIL a floor-kind failure alerts (3e-12 after 23)
ok   a failure at 5e-17 after 23 does not (below 1e-13)
ok   an edge failure at 4e-10 after 8 does not
FAIL a polish at 3e-16 alerts
ok   a polish at 3e-18 does not (below 1e-16)
ok   a polish at 3.3e-22 does not
